--- R-devel/howto.md	(revision 6991)
+++ R-devel/howto.md	(working copy)
@@ -182,6 +182,20 @@
 And a similar trick can be used to obtain other files that always exist but
 have changing version names.
 
+To build R with FlexiBLAS, so that the BLAS and LAPACK can be switched at
+run time, also download the FlexiBLAS bundle from the same place, a file
+named such as `flexiblas-6536-6492.zip`, to the directory holding the R
+sources, and unpack it into them:
+
+```
+FBBUNDLE=flexiblas-6536-6492.zip
+wget https://cran.r-project.org/bin/windows/Rtools/rtools45/files/$FBBUNDLE
+unzip $FBBUNDLE -d trunk
+```
+
+The corresponding version of the bundle for ARM would be named
+`flexiblas-aarch64-6536-6492.zip`.
+
